{"repositoryId":1258916652,"availability":"available","full":"yoyoys/kroki-editor","name":"kroki-editor","description":"A Kroki online editor","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":8,"forks":2,"created":"2026-06-04T03:19:43Z","updated":"2026-06-05T03:18:57Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yoyoys.github.io/kroki-editor/","topics":[],"demo":"https://yoyoys.github.io/kroki-editor/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.804Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.804Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.804Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.804Z","stars":8,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Write diagram-as-code, preview it live, and copy an image URL to embed anywhere — a fast, self-hostable web editor for Kroki.","I build a lot of diagrams at work and embed them into our documentation system. Most documentation platforms only render Mermaid natively — and handy as Mermaid is, it doesn't cover everything I need: more diagram types, finer layout control, the right tool for each job.","Kroki solves the rendering side. It turns text into 25 diagram languages (PlantUML, GraphViz, D2, BPMN, and more) and serves each diagram as a plain image URL. That URL embeds into any docs system that accepts an image — regardless of whether the platform itself understands the diagram language."],"features":["✍️ Live preview — edit diagram source on the left, see it render on the right (debounced).","🧩 Every Kroki diagram type — PlantUML, Mermaid, GraphViz, D2, BPMN, and the rest. The type menu is configurable.","🎨 Syntax highlighting — Mermaid, JSON (Vega/Vega-Lite/Excalidraw/WaveDrom), XML (BPMN), YAML (WireViz), LaTeX (TikZ), SQL (DBML), plus lightweight highlighters for PlantUML, D2, GraphViz and the blockdiag family.","📱 Mobile-friendly — single-pane Edit/View toggle on small screens; draggable split on desktop.","🔍 Considered zoom/pan — +/−/Fit/1:1 buttons and drag-to-pan (no surprise scroll-zoom); pinch on touch; a fullscreen mode with a minimap."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yoyoys/kroki-editor/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3f05960473743c20dffb3d41b10798eedc8047854e06a81589a15228bd3565c9","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.981Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.981Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Write diagram-as-code, preview it live, and copy an image URL to embed anywhere — a fast, self-hostable web editor for Kroki.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yoyoys/kroki-editor/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Useful when your self-hosted Kroki doesn't run the Mermaid companion container.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yoyoys/kroki-editor/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"3f05960473743c20dffb3d41b10798eedc8047854e06a81589a15228bd3565c9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yoyoys/kroki-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.981Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-06-05T03:18:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yoyoys/kroki-editor/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:04:44.981Z","hash":"3f05960473743c20dffb3d41b10798eedc8047854e06a81589a15228bd3565c9","originalBytes":7197,"storedBytes":7197,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["kroki","mermaid","diagram","image","editor","url","copy","live","bpmn","gallery","graphviz","license","plantuml","preview","render","source","any","browser","container","diagrams","docs","embed","examples","open","run","types","under","apache","blockdiag","build","client-side","companion","dark","dbml","development.md","diagram.puml","docker","documentation","doesn","e.g.","each","edit","editable","english","everything","excalidraw","feedback","highlighting","images","instance","json","latex","light","lightweight","plain","plus","point","quick","rendering","right","searchable","self-hostable","served","sql